00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:25,000
There's simple answers and there's complicated answers.

818
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,000
The simple answer is:

819
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:29,000
being an eagle scout is a state of mind.

820
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:31,000
One of the amazing things about the eagle award is

821
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:33,000
it's the only award of childhood that stays with you

822
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:35,000
